' Style commun des diagrammes XelWóor, aux couleurs de la charte du mémoire
' (brun #4A2E1B, brun clair #995932, sable #C19A6B, fonds beige).
' Inclus par chaque .puml avec : !include charte.iuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4A2E1B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classBorderColor #995932
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor #F3E9DD
skinparam packageBorderColor #4A2E1B
skinparam componentBorderColor #995932
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam nodeBorderColor #4A2E1B
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #FAF5EF
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #995932
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam actorBorderColor #4A2E1B
skinparam activityBorderColor #995932
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #C19A6B
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #995932
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C19A6B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FAF5EF
skinparam noteBorderColor #C19A6B
skinparam databaseBorderColor #4A2E1B
